  "question": {
    "text": "How many acidic H-atoms are present in this compound that can react with <math><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>⊖</mo></mrow></mover></math> for R-MgX to give alkane<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/3b81a9d5-de94-461f-b62a-4020787d53bf.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.475in;height:2.125in\" />",
    "image": null
